    {
      "title": "Validate, score and refill",
      "summary": "The dealer converts a three-token selection into cards, validates the Set rule, removes a winning triple and associated tokens, then communicates a point or penalty to the waiting player.",
      "details": [
        "A valid set has each feature either equal across all three cards or different across all three.",
        "Point and penalty freezes temporarily suppress player input.",
        "Card replacement and countdown management belong to the dealer."
      ],
