        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Keep shared card mappings together",
      "implementation": "Table methods update slot-to-card and card-to-slot mappings alongside UI operations; a fair semaphore and synchronized blocks coordinate access.",
      "whyItMatters": "The case study can explain a concrete invariant instead of making an unverified claim that the entire game is race-free.",
